<title>USA: Union Corp Q2 Dec 31 net rises.</title>
<headline>Union Corp Q2 Dec 31 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		  0.24 Shr loss	 0.17</p>
<p> Net profit		 1,441 Net loss	   967</p>
<p> Revs			28,977		   24,069</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   5,900		    5,748</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		  0.51   profit	  0.02</p>
<p> Net profit		 2,998   profit	   110</p>
<p> Revs			57,718		   48,056</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   5,905		    5,735</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company recorded a charge of $2.06 million in 1995, or $0.36 per share, for discontinued operations.</p>
<p>For Q2 1996, operating net per share was $0.24, compared to an operating net per share of $0.19 for the same period in 1995. For the six-month 1996 period, operating net per share was $0.51, compared to $0.38 for the same period the year before.</p>
</text>
